      "definition": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.is_admin()\n RETURNS boolean\n LANGUAGE sql\n STABLE SECURITY DEFINER\n SET search_path TO 'public'\nAS $function$\r\n  select exists (\r\n    select 1 from public.app_users\r\n    where id = auth.uid()\r\n      and role = 'admin'\r\n      and account_state = 'active'\r\n  );\r\n$function$\n",
